          "marks": [
            "l6s1",
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6s3",
          "text": ", we’ve helped people through moments like this. Knowing what’s expected after a car accident or hit-and-run can protect your future. ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
